{"relation_id": "REL-20261106-2c65c5", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261106-05fba8"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-002"}, "note": "cis記憶の局所アドレス像で、書庫のパス/ID/来歴を読み替える。ただし自動継承は借用しない。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261106-fecb65", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261106-9960da"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-002"}, "note": "訓練免疫を応答の偏向として読み、書庫のノートは次の読み手の状態に依存する外部痕跡とする。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261106-cd7158", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261106-2e5f50"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-003"}, "note": "価値による長期記憶の層状化を、salience/ノート/関係線による参照優先度の形成へ読み替える。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261106-3f50a9", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261106-a18266"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261105-72dbc2"}, "note": "触知時間の変調と正答率非有意差が、生理的変調と一人称報告を分ける修正に応答する。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261106-dbfac9", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261106-4c01fa"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-003"}, "note": "後の情動学習による遡及的強化を、後の読みによる行の価値変更として読み替える。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261106-102e01", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261106-4c01fa"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261106-2e5f50"}, "note": "どちらも後の価値/再処理が記憶の優先度を変える。ただし睡眠と情動学習の機構は異なる。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261106-f828f0", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261106-05fba8"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-EVD-20261106-9960da"}, "note": "中央の物語ではなく局所状態/応答偏向が過去を保持する点で共鳴する。階層と持続機構は異なる。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261106-2fe7ff", "left": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261106-2f24a1"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "note", "id": "NOTE-20261106-e4e836"}, "note": "経験未決とファイルの非自動再活性化を維持しつつ、局所記憶・訓練・価値・リズム・遡及の5件で自己の操作履歴を補う。", "created_at": "2026-11-06"}
